1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,900
MENDAKI is introducing

2
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:01,740
the Ready for School

3
00:00:01,740 --> 00:00:03,180
e-voucher initiative

4
00:00:03,180 --> 00:00:04,140
which we hope to help kids

5
00:00:04,140 --> 00:00:04,860
from Primary One

6
00:00:04,860 --> 00:00:06,760
all the way up to university.

7
00:00:06,760 --> 00:00:07,360
This year, MENDAKI

8
00:00:07,360 --> 00:00:08,940
is giving out $250 e-vouchers

9
00:00:08,940 --> 00:00:10,120
that parents can use

10
00:00:10,120 --> 00:00:11,240
for their children

11
00:00:11,240 --> 00:00:12,400
whether it's schoolbooks

12
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:13,740
whether it is stationery

13
00:00:13,740 --> 00:00:14,940
or even shoes.

14
00:00:14,940 --> 00:00:16,020
So, as we begin the school year

15
00:00:16,020 --> 00:00:17,320
for many parents

16
00:00:17,320 --> 00:00:18,120
it's also a time where

17
00:00:18,120 --> 00:00:18,660
there are a lot of

18
00:00:18,660 --> 00:00:19,640
expenses for school

19
00:00:19,640 --> 00:00:20,320
and we want our kids

20
00:00:20,320 --> 00:00:22,020
to have the best start in life.

21
00:00:22,020 --> 00:00:22,960
And during these times

22
00:00:22,960 --> 00:00:23,720
especially when you have

23
00:00:23,720 --> 00:00:25,160
cost of living concerns

24
00:00:25,160 --> 00:00:25,960
challenging times

25
00:00:25,960 --> 00:00:26,800
we want to help parents

26
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:27,520
from low-income families

27
00:00:27,520 --> 00:00:28,240
to support their kids.

28
00:00:28,240 --> 00:00:29,540
I think it's important because

29
00:00:29,540 --> 00:00:30,140
especially for parents

30
00:00:30,140 --> 00:00:31,360
who have more than one child

31
00:00:31,360 --> 00:00:31,840
as you know

32
00:00:31,840 --> 00:00:32,300
sometimes you have

33
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:33,220
two or three kids

34
00:00:33,220 --> 00:00:34,060
I think it's always challenging

35
00:00:34,060 --> 00:00:35,380
to try to fork out

36
00:00:35,380 --> 00:00:36,620
that much expense at one go.

37
00:00:36,620 --> 00:00:37,680
We are pegging it at about

38
00:00:37,680 --> 00:00:39,020
$1,000 per capita income

39
00:00:39,020 --> 00:00:39,640
and below.

40
00:00:39,640 --> 00:00:40,880
So we expect more than

41
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:42,360
22,000 students

42
00:00:42,360 --> 00:00:43,840
who could benefit from this

43
00:00:43,840 --> 00:00:44,740
and this is in addition to

44
00:00:44,740 --> 00:00:45,820
about 13,000 others

45
00:00:45,820 --> 00:00:46,760
that typically benefit

46
00:00:46,760 --> 00:00:47,640
from our TTFS

47
00:00:47,640 --> 00:00:48,560
and other MENDAKI schemes

48
00:00:48,560 --> 00:00:49,140
as well.

49
00:00:49,140 --> 00:00:50,080
So it's an application basis

50
00:00:50,080 --> 00:00:50,700
and we start to take

51
00:00:50,700 --> 00:00:52,040
applications from 1st December.

52
00:00:52,040 --> 00:00:52,960
So we hope that this

53
00:00:52,960 --> 00:00:54,180
will do its part

54
00:00:54,180 --> 00:00:55,540
to help parents and children

55
00:00:55,540 --> 00:00:56,860
have a good start for the year

56
00:00:56,860 --> 00:00:57,560
and not to worry

57
00:00:57,560 --> 00:00:58,760
about some of these expenses

58
00:00:58,760 --> 00:00:59,560
that would have otherwise

59
00:00:59,560 --> 00:01:01,300
held them back.
